    ],
    "rulings": [
      {
        "answer": "No, the 2 cards you add to your hand are cards that fulfill either of the conditions: a card with [Lucemon] or a card with the [Royal Knight] trait. Therefore, in addition to the combinations from your question, you can also add 1 card with [Lucemon] and 1 card with the [Royal Knight] trait to your hand.",
        "question": "Do I have to choose 2 cards with [Lucemon] or 2 cards with the [Royal Knight] trait among the revealed cards to add to my hand for this card's [On Play][When Digivolving] effect?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      },
      {
        "answer": "Yes, you can.  In such cases, you add as many cards to your hand as possible.",
        "question": "Can I use this card's [On Play] [When Digivolving] effect to add a card to my hand when only 1 card with [Lucemon] or the [Royal Knight] trait is among the 5 revealed cards?",
        "reference": "[1]"
      }
    ]
